{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_192_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_192","textTraditional":"一、十有二年。春，齊高偃帥師納北燕伯于陽。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_192_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_192","textTraditional":"伯于陽者何？公子陽生也。子曰：「我乃知之矣。」在側者曰：「子茍知之，何以不革？」曰：「如爾所不知何？春秋之信史也，其序則齊桓晉文，其會則主會者為之也，其詞則丘有罪焉耳！」","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_192_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_192","textTraditional":"二、三月壬申，鄭伯嘉卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_192_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_192","textTraditional":"三、夏，宋公使華定來聘。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_192_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_192","textTraditional":"四、公如晉，至河乃復。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_192_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_192","textTraditional":"五、五月，葬鄭簡公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_192_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_192","textTraditional":"六、楚殺其大夫成然。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_192_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_192","textTraditional":"七、秋七月。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_192_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_192","textTraditional":"八、冬十月，公子整出奔齊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_192_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_192","textTraditional":"九、楚子伐徐。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_192_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_192","textTraditional":"十、晉伐鮮虞。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}